WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
That's how it is

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,440
General Lu, do you understand?

3
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:03,400
Pretty much the same

4
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,400
But he is not as handsome as me

5
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,920
But it's not as sad as you said

6
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:08,710
Ghost Mansion Tea

7
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:10,270
Living people feel relaxed after drinking it

8
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,830
I haven’t asked my little brother what his surname is, Zhou Tie.

9
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:13,870
So that's it

10
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:14,910
So that's it

11
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:17,190
What are you doing

12
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:19,470
You won’t keep me here to make trouble with you, don’t worry

13
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:20,990
I don’t have the ruffians of Longyang

14
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:22,270
There is grievance between you and me

15
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:23,990
Strictly speaking, I owe you my life

16
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:24,990
Goodbye today

17
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:26,190
This king makes a promise to you

18
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,150
What injustice

19
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:28,470
Can a promise be exchanged for love?

20
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:30,670
You are still the same as before, but you are as frank as ever

21
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:31,710
In danger in the future

22
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:33,470
Just replace the three words Zhenbiewang

23
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:34,470
no matter when and where

24
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:35,870
This king must go to help

25
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:36,830
It's time for you to wake up

26
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,590
Yesterday I saw your yard with bare lips like that

27
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:39,510
I'm off work today

28
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:40,830
Come and help you get back on your feet

29
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:41,830
Brother Fu Chun eats first

30
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:43,230
How to work when you are hungry

31
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:44,750
I heard people in the village say

32
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:45,910
You established a prince

33
00:00:45,910 --> 00:00:47,190
Then help me look at marriage

34
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:48,950
My wife and I are not doing well lately

35
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:50,920
As much as you say

36
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,840
I believe in you, Brother Fu Chun

37
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:54,640
Our relationship is not about money.

38
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:55,880
Just treat me to a meal

39
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,960
Mainly because I don’t care about marriage

40
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,400
Then I ask about work

41
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,920
There is a book that wants to take me into business

42
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,520
Thanks to my mother-in-law, I will give you the eight words of your birthday.

43
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,000
The man crossed the Mediterranean with beer

44
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,360
The little leather bag that goes from house to house talks so easily, that's right, that's him.

45
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:09,000
This morning he asked me for 5,000 yuan for travel expenses.

46
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,190
Then you still agree?

47
00:01:11,190 --> 00:01:12,710
Look, this is the message he sent me

48
00:01:12,710 --> 00:01:16,880
To be honest, there aren't many people around, so why not go there?

49
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:19,320
Didn’t I tell you to have dinner at Xiaotie’s house?

50
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:20,680
Xiaotie, I have to leave beforehand.

51
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,680
Make an appointment another day

52
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:22,920
I hope nothing happens
